      "Section": "Ad Lift Test Benchmark",
      "Anchor": "ad-lift-test-benchmark",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Using Brand Lift Testing you can provide advertiser access to the median aggregated lift test results data organized by specific region and industry.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Lift Test Benchmark",
      "Anchor": "ad-lift-test-benchmark",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The specific region and industry lift test data are grouped by key metric types. For a description of the key metric types refer to Available Key Metrics.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Lift Test Benchmark",
      "Anchor": "ad-lift-test-benchmark",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note: Brand Lift benchmarks offer empirical guidance and insights rather than data that has been tested and validated for statistical significance.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
