    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder",
      "Anchor": "get-ad-lift-test-benchmark-results-finder",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder fetches benchmark results by using the lift test geographic region and industry to locate peer group URN test results.\nKey Metric data is returned if it exists and conforms to statistical strength requirements. If no key metric result is returned, then a benchmark group either doesn\u0027t exist or there\u0027s not a significant amount of peer group data.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder",
      "Anchor": "get-ad-lift-test-benchmark-results-finder",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "Your request must include the Restli Protocol 2.0.0 as X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0 header. Restli 2.0 requires URL encoded URNs in query params. For example, urn:li:adLiftTest:1245678 becomes urn%3Ali%3AadLiftTest%3A1245678.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Query Parameters",
      "Anchor": "query-parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder",
        "Query Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Type",
        "Description",
        "Required"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "adLiftTest",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Ad Lift Test URN",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The selected ad lift tests to fetch benchmarking results for",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/adLiftTestBenchmark?q=adLiftTest\u0026adLiftTests=urn%3Ali%3AadLiftTest%3A{liftTestId}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "The API returns benchmark results for a specific lift test. It uses industry and geographic URN values to define a peer group. It fetches median values for the identified group for each key metric. The API returns results if they\u0027re available. If no results are returned, there\u0027s likely insufficient data to calculate return values.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Get Ad Lift Test Benchmark Results Finder",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022elements\u0022:[\n        {\n            \u0022benchmarkMetrics\u0022:[\n                {\n                    \u0022benchmarkMetrics\u0022:{\n                        \u0022totalEstimatedLift\u0022:62666,\n                        \u0022absoluteLift\u0022:0.06563,\n                        \u0022relativeLift\u0022:0.726425\n                    },\n                    \u0022id\u0022:\u0022RECALL\u0022\n                }\n            ],\n            \u0022peerGroupType\u0022:\u0022GEO\u0022\n        },\n        {\n            \u0022benchmarkMetrics\u0022:[\n                {\n                    \u0022benchmarkMetrics\u0022:{\n                        \u0022totalEstimatedLift\u0022:45481,\n                        \u0022absoluteLift\u0022:0.074857,\n                        \u0022relativeLift\u0022:0.613321\n                    },\n                    \u0022id\u0022:\u0022RECALL\u0022\n                }\n            ],\n            \u0022peerGroupType\u0022:\u0022INDUSTRY\u0022\n        }\n    ]\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
